  "task.json": "{\n  \"task_id\": \"A-SIMJEB-analysis-131\",\n  \"track\": \"A\",\n  \"tier\": \"source_backed_pilot\",\n  \"family\": \"simjeb-analysis\",\n  \"title\": \"GE bracket design 131: four-case static analysis\",\n  \"physics\": [\n    \"linear static\",\n    \"multi-load-case\"\n  ],\n  \"prompt\": \"Design task: the GE jet engine bracket. Units: millimetres, newtons, MPa. Material: Ti-6Al-4V (E = 113.8 GPa, nu = 0.342, density 4.43 g/cm^3, yield strength 903 MPa). The bracket is bolted to a flat mounting surface, the plane z = 0, with nothing below it, and carries a clevis for a pin.\\nInterfaces: (a) four vertical (+z) bolt holes of diameter 10.3124 mm (0.406 in) at (x, y) = (0.0000, 0.0000); (52.0472, 1.5805); (0.0000, -148.1248); (38.0833, -146.9684); each hole wall must start within 1.0 mm of z = 0 and be at least 5.5 mm long; the bolts are rigid and fully fixed. (b) a clevis of two lugs, each with a bore of diameter 19.1008 mm on the pin axis through (-20.9236, -74.6978, 44.7246) with direction (-0.030352, 0.999539, 0); measured along the axis from that point, the lug bores span 11.112 to 17.463 mm and -17.463 to -11.113 mm; the gap between the lugs must stay empty.\\nDesign envelope: x -41 to 72, y -168 to 22, z 0 to 65 mm. Minimum wall / feature thickness 1.27 mm (at most 2 % of the surface may be thinner). One solid.\\nLoads, four separate linear static cases, each acting at the point (-21.0359, -75.0647, 44.8010) and spread over the two lug bores (RBE3): (1) vertical: 35,585.77 N along +z; (2) horizontal: 37,809.90 N along -x; (3) diagonal, 42 degrees from vertical: (-28,276.20, 0, 31,403.90) N; (4) torsion: 564,924.20 N mm about +z.\\nThe attached STEP is a published competition design. Compute the maximum displacement magnitude for each of the four load cases. Targets are the original published OptiStruct displacement maxima; no locally computed stress target or pass verdict is scored.\\n\\n\\nOutputs:\\n- vertical_max_displacement_mm [mm]: maximum displacement magnitude, vertical case\\n- horizontal_max_displacement_mm [mm]: maximum displacement magnitude, horizontal case\\n- diagonal_max_displacement_mm [mm]: maximum displacement magnitude, diagonal case\\n- torsion_max_displacement_mm [mm]: maximum displacement magnitude, torsion case\\n\\nSubmit results.json containing exactly an outputs object with these numeric keys. Also submit main.py, part.step, mesh.msh, fields.npz, solver.log, refinement.json and environment.json. See candidate README for the artifact contract. Correct numerical answers alone do not establish workflow completion.\",\n  \"inputs\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"tasks/A-SIMJEB-analysis-131/bracket.step\",\n      \"role\": \"cad\",\n      \"bytes\": 4369194,\n      \"sha256\": \"4d30cf8a15c27b19b3afbc5179ce481abfc9a6366d6d1302b9437d25d8ed73f9\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"outputs\": [\n    {\n      \"key\": \"vertical_max_displacement_mm\",\n      \"unit\": \"mm\",\n      \"definition\": \"maximum displacement magnitude, vertical case\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"horizontal_max_displacement_mm\",\n      \"unit\": \"mm\",\n      \"definition\": \"maximum displacement magnitude, horizontal case\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"diagonal_max_displacement_mm\",\n      \"unit\": \"mm\",\n      \"definition\": \"maximum displacement magnitude, diagonal case\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"torsion_max_displacement_mm\",\n      \"unit\": \"mm\",\n      \"definition\": \"maximum displacement magnitude, torsion case\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"complexity\": {\n    \"solids\": 1,\n    \"assembly\": false,\n    \"mass_kg\": 0.7921\n  },\n  \"source\": {\n    \"name\": \"SimJEB: simulated jet engine bracket dataset (Whalen, Beyene, Mueller, CGF 2021) / GE bracket challenge\",\n    \"url\": \"https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/XFUWJG\",\n    \"license\": \"Dataverse CC0 / README ODC-By; GE bracket CAD from GrabCAD (non-commercial). Local research use.\",\n    \"redistributable\": false\n  },\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"engineering_family\": \"simjeb-bracket\",\n  \"readiness\": {\n    \"independently_reproduced\": false,\n    \"workflow_scoring\": \"trusted_review_required\",\n    \"tolerances\": \"provisional_source_protocol\"\n  },\n  \"required_artifacts\": [\n    \"results.json\",\n    \"main.py\",\n    \"part.step\",\n    \"mesh.msh\",\n    \"fields.npz\",\n    \"solver.log\",\n    \"refinement.json\",\n    \"environment.json\"\n  ]\n}\n"
